---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { Menu, Menubar } from "astro-ink";
---
<Base title="Menubar">
  <div class="docs-page">
    <h1>Menubar</h1>
    <p class="docs-lede">
      Desktop-style menu bar: left and right arrows travel between menus,
      each menu behaves like <code>Menu</code>.
    </p>

    <h2>Example</h2>
    <div class="docs-example" style="display: grid;">
      <Menubar label="Editor">
        <Menu label="File menu">
          <button slot="trigger" type="button" data-ink-menu-trigger>File</button>
          <a role="menuitem" href="/components">Open library</a>
          <button role="menuitem" type="button">Save draft</button>
        </Menu>
        <Menu label="Edit menu">
          <button slot="trigger" type="button" data-ink-menu-trigger>Edit</button>
          <button role="menuitem" type="button">Undo</button>
          <button role="menuitem" type="button">Redo</button>
        </Menu>
      </Menubar>
    </div>
    <pre class="docs-code"><code>&lt;Menubar label="Editor"&gt;
  &lt;Menu label="File menu"&gt;
    &lt;button slot="trigger" type="button" data-ink-menu-trigger&gt;File&lt;/button&gt;
    &lt;a role="menuitem" href="/components"&gt;Open library&lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;/Menu&gt;
  ...
&lt;/Menubar&gt;</code></pre>

    <h2>Props</h2>
    <table class="docs-table">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>label</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td><code>Main menu</code></td><td>Landmark name.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Accessibility</h2>
    <ul class="docs-list">
      <li>ArrowLeft/Right move between menu triggers; arrows inside menus work like <code>Menu</code>.</li>
      <li>Trigger buttons are 44px with visible focus.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
